<div class="mx-auto max-w-md">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">设置新密码</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">请设置新的账号密码（至少 8 位）。完成后所有已登录设备会被强制下线。</p>

    <form method="post" action="/reset-password/<%= encodeURIComponent(token) %>" class="mt-6 space-y-4">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>" />
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">新密码</label>
        <input type="password" name="password" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password"
               class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm shadow-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-100" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">再输一次</label>
        <input type="password" name="confirm" required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password"
               class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm shadow-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-100" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="w-full inline-flex justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-700">设置新密码</button>
    </form>

    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
      链接已过期？<a href="/forgot-password" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700">重新申请</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
